1
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,437
We've kept men off this island for
centuries, excluding a slip-up or two.

2
00:00:16,520 --> 00:00:19,677
To think that those barbarians
would invade us now.

3
00:00:19,760 --> 00:00:24,231
They cut out a whole chunk of the
mountain and the town was heavily damaged.

4
00:00:24,460 --> 00:00:27,237
As long as I'm here, the
navy will keep coming back.

5
00:00:27,320 --> 00:00:28,440
Where should I go?

6
00:00:29,400 --> 00:00:31,700
Oh, at times like this.

7
00:00:33,140 --> 00:00:35,020
I just want to marry Luffy.

8
00:00:35,400 --> 00:00:37,400
Don't you always want that?

9
00:00:51,800 --> 00:00:53,440
The gate's been destroyed!

10
00:01:05,920 --> 00:01:06,977
Don't let up yet.

11
00:01:07,060 --> 00:01:09,820
Not till we send him to
the bottom of the sea.

12
00:01:12,640 --> 00:01:14,720
Deploy the pacifistas. Immediately.

13
00:01:15,320 --> 00:01:16,150
Seraphim, go.

14
00:01:16,233 --> 00:01:17,337
Activate the camera.

15
00:01:17,420 --> 00:01:18,897
We need to record this battle.

16
00:01:18,980 --> 00:01:19,817
Roger that.

17
00:01:19,900 --> 00:01:22,580
Still not coming out to fight, Hancock.

18
00:01:25,920 --> 00:01:27,457
A warship is approaching!

19
00:01:27,540 --> 00:01:28,780
from 6 o 'clock!

20
00:01:29,620 --> 00:01:33,200
It's a pirate ship! This
is mad! What happened?

21
00:01:38,700 --> 00:01:40,417
They're back here in the city!

22
00:01:40,500 --> 00:01:41,697
Black Moon's attacking!

23
00:01:41,780 --> 00:01:42,840
Everyone hold on!

24
00:01:42,940 --> 00:01:43,940
It's a sea plane!

25
00:01:44,080 --> 00:01:45,904
It's gonna anger the Sea Kings!

26
00:01:51,520 --> 00:01:53,180
Is that a child?

27
00:01:53,620 --> 00:01:55,197
We can't fight a little girl!

28
00:01:55,280 --> 00:01:57,380
How she's so strong?

29
00:01:57,620 --> 00:01:58,561
And look at her.

30
00:01:58,740 --> 00:02:00,080
I don't understand.

31
00:02:12,460 --> 00:02:15,380
Oh, Pirate Empress, come out to play.

32
00:02:20,840 --> 00:02:24,680
We came for a visit and to
take your Devil Fruit power.

33
00:02:27,340 --> 00:02:30,260
Oh, Hancock, what a
gorgeous face you have.

34
00:02:30,480 --> 00:02:33,617
I would love to take your head
and keep it as a treasure.

35
00:02:33,700 --> 00:02:37,582
As long as I get her power, you
can do whatever the hell you want.

36
00:02:37,880 --> 00:02:41,217
Well, if that's the case, don't
chop her head off right away.

37
00:02:41,300 --> 00:02:44,535
Let's take her alive and we
can have some fun with her.

38
00:02:49,560 --> 00:02:51,678
Blackbeard, that's as far as you go.

39
00:02:52,880 --> 00:02:56,056
Vice Admiral, sir, we've
made contact with Blackbeard.

40
00:02:56,200 --> 00:02:57,537
Give the order to attack.

41
00:02:57,620 --> 00:02:59,260
Wait for HQ's approval.

42
00:03:00,420 --> 00:03:01,250
Carlike.

43
00:03:01,333 --> 00:03:02,560
Stay out of my way!

44
00:03:23,940 --> 00:03:26,500
Hancock, get your ass out here!

45
00:03:33,360 --> 00:03:35,240
Blackbeard is here? I see.

46
00:03:35,440 --> 00:03:37,617
I suppose there are plenty
of reasons why pirates

47
00:03:37,700 --> 00:03:40,641
like him would want to
target the former warlords.

48
00:03:46,420 --> 00:03:48,655
We'll never gain any ground like this.

49
00:03:49,080 --> 00:03:49,910
Watch out!

50
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:55,120
Thanks for that. Anytime.

51
00:03:55,720 --> 00:04:00,308
Now let's hurry up and take care of this
before there are any more casualties.

52
00:04:01,340 --> 00:04:02,170
Hancock!

53
00:04:02,320 --> 00:04:05,673
The Navy does not desire a
fight with you or your people.

54
00:04:05,940 --> 00:04:09,881
If we can take you into custody,
then we will withdraw immediately.

55
00:04:11,880 --> 00:04:13,200
Don't push your luck.

56
00:04:13,760 --> 00:04:15,020
Kobe the hero.

57
00:04:15,480 --> 00:04:17,900
We'll handle him, sister. Stay inside.

58
00:04:18,520 --> 00:04:19,620
Don't be absurd.

59
00:04:20,600 --> 00:04:22,180
They can't capture me.

60
00:04:22,500 --> 00:04:23,520
No one can.

61
00:04:25,620 --> 00:04:28,020
I will never bow to the likes of them.

62
00:04:29,820 --> 00:04:30,880
Don't do this.

63
00:04:31,100 --> 00:04:32,320
Let us protect you.

64
00:04:33,320 --> 00:04:34,520
Commodore Dash!

65
00:04:34,760 --> 00:04:36,525
Nothing's working on this guy!

66
00:04:41,520 --> 00:04:43,120
Are you kidding me?

67
00:04:43,380 --> 00:04:46,733
You all got your asses kicked
for that one little shrimp?

68
00:04:54,960 --> 00:04:57,100
Wait, that kid.

69
00:04:58,180 --> 00:05:02,380
He's got white hair, brown
skin, and black wings.

70
00:05:21,340 --> 00:05:23,120
P-X?

71
00:05:26,900 --> 00:05:28,420
It can't be!

72
00:05:28,700 --> 00:05:30,220
He's a pacifista!

73
00:05:59,120 --> 00:06:01,414
Airman, pacifist a brat, I'll kill him!

74
00:06:02,600 --> 00:06:04,280
Where the hell is he?

75
00:06:10,040 --> 00:06:12,800
He's small, but his arm...

76
00:06:15,160 --> 00:06:16,860
is huge.

77
00:06:18,560 --> 00:06:20,140
All right, then.

78
00:06:20,680 --> 00:06:21,720
Let's go!

79
00:06:36,640 --> 00:06:37,880
Whoa, man.

80
00:06:38,180 --> 00:06:39,680
This isn't looking good.

81
00:06:45,220 --> 00:06:46,540
Oh, wee!

82
00:06:47,700 --> 00:06:49,840
Why, hello there, lovely.

83
00:06:52,680 --> 00:06:55,200
Even the Blackbeard Pirates are affected.

84
00:06:58,500 --> 00:06:59,680
Slave Ow!

85
00:07:07,880 --> 00:07:09,140
This is a mess.

86
00:07:09,400 --> 00:07:11,576
We've got to stop her quick, Helmepo.

87
00:07:14,140 --> 00:07:15,120
Helmepo, no!

88
00:07:15,540 --> 00:07:17,160
The Vice Admiral, too?

89
00:07:20,080 --> 00:07:21,900
Pacifistas, stand down!

90
00:07:31,580 --> 00:07:34,417
They'll break all of the
people who are petrified!

91
00:07:34,500 --> 00:07:35,330
Pacifistas!

92
00:07:35,440 --> 00:07:36,440
This is an order!

93
00:07:36,760 --> 00:07:37,720
Stop attacking!

94
00:07:38,920 --> 00:07:40,340
So that's Kobe.

95
00:07:44,300 --> 00:07:45,130
Perfume!

96
00:07:48,940 --> 00:07:50,260
She's too fast!

97
00:07:51,900 --> 00:07:53,060
Black Vortex!

98
00:08:00,900 --> 00:08:03,480
Like that stopped you dead in your tracks.

99
00:08:04,440 --> 00:08:05,900
This is darkness.

100
00:08:06,400 --> 00:08:09,160
It absorbs all Devil Fruit powers.

101
00:08:16,900 --> 00:08:18,680
Snake Princess! What happened?

102
00:08:18,860 --> 00:08:20,742
She can't use her power anymore?

103
00:08:22,060 --> 00:08:23,057
You're disgusting.

104
00:08:23,140 --> 00:08:24,500
Unhand me at once.

105
00:08:24,840 --> 00:08:28,697
I should have known the pirate empress
wouldn't give up without a fight.

106
00:08:28,780 --> 00:08:31,309
You certainly did a
number on my crewmates.

107
00:08:31,400 --> 00:08:34,635
Turned those idiots to stone
the second they showed up.

108
00:08:36,400 --> 00:08:40,480
I knew she was tough, but this
is beyond anything I imagined.

109
00:08:40,820 --> 00:08:41,980
What should I do?

110
00:08:42,440 --> 00:08:46,380
That power of yours, I think it's
going to serve me quite nicely.

111
00:08:47,180 --> 00:08:50,640
Do as you will, but my power
is useless without my beauty.

112
00:08:51,100 --> 00:08:54,720
And if you kill me, your
crewmates will remain petrified.

113
00:08:55,020 --> 00:08:58,120
The next wielder cannot
undo the damage I've done.

114
00:09:01,120 --> 00:09:03,260
We're not getting anywhere, are we?

115
00:09:03,500 --> 00:09:04,700
Help me out, Kobe.

116
00:09:06,120 --> 00:09:08,700
You did me a real favor last time we met.

117
00:09:08,900 --> 00:09:11,100
You were my hero at Rocky Port 2.

118
00:09:12,060 --> 00:09:14,100
I've been on a roll thanks to you.

119
00:09:14,280 --> 00:09:16,140
I was able to take down Wong Z.

120
00:09:16,380 --> 00:09:19,680
And now, Pirate Island is
my personal playground.

121
00:09:29,120 --> 00:09:31,020
Well, what do you think?

122
00:09:31,560 --> 00:09:35,120
Make the call if I take my hands
off her like she requested.

123
00:09:35,440 --> 00:09:37,357
Do you think she'll keep her word?

124
00:09:37,440 --> 00:09:41,440
Will she have any incentive to turn
my crewmates back if she's free?

125
00:09:43,320 --> 00:09:48,017
She needs to turn back everyone here
who was petrified, marines included.

126
00:09:48,100 --> 00:09:49,597
I don't want to fight.

127
00:09:49,680 --> 00:09:52,017
You, if you leave, I'll set them all free.

128
00:09:52,100 --> 00:09:54,757
Do we have a deal?

129
00:09:54,840 --> 00:09:57,137
Hell, no!

130
00:09:57,220 --> 00:09:59,500
You're a liar.

131
00:10:01,860 --> 00:10:06,417
As soon as I let you go, you'll
turn everyone here into a statue.

132
00:10:06,500 --> 00:10:09,237
We'll be dead, just like that!

133
00:10:09,320 --> 00:10:10,800
Am I wrong?

134
00:10:15,560 --> 00:10:18,340
As you've said, you're quite the beauty.

135
00:10:18,600 --> 00:10:24,160
No one who sets eyes on you can resist
your power, no matter how strong you are.

136
00:10:25,040 --> 00:10:27,160
So, what to do?

137
00:10:29,660 --> 00:10:31,420
Safer to just kill you!

138
00:10:34,200 --> 00:10:35,760
Don't do this, Blackbeard!

139
00:10:36,140 --> 00:10:39,081
Think of how many lives
we'll be lost if she dies!

140
00:10:53,140 --> 00:10:55,493
I knew the Navy would attack eventually,

141
00:10:55,720 --> 00:11:01,757
but I never imagined they'd
cut a hole out the island,

142
00:11:01,840 --> 00:11:07,877
sorry

143
00:11:07,960 --> 00:11:10,157
to make you wait, Hancock!

144
00:11:10,240 --> 00:11:11,497
I'm here now.

145
00:11:11,580 --> 00:11:16,937
As for you,

146
00:11:17,020 --> 00:11:19,457
don't test my patience any further!

147
00:11:19,540 --> 00:11:25,537
I never did like you,
Whitebeard's cabin boy!

148
00:11:25,620 --> 00:11:26,700
Let's make this

149
00:11:35,980 --> 00:11:36,810
Quick!

150
00:11:50,460 --> 00:11:54,117
Listen Hancock turn
everyone back to normal.

151
00:11:54,200 --> 00:11:56,024
I'll keep your enemies in check

152
00:11:57,000 --> 00:11:59,100
None of you try anything foolish.

153
00:11:59,660 --> 00:12:01,740
Leave this island in peace.

154
00:12:14,120 --> 00:12:16,060
I'm glad you're still alive.

155
00:12:16,840 --> 00:12:19,016
Dangerous times we're living in, huh?

156
00:12:20,620 --> 00:12:23,480
We owe you our lives, Rayleigh. Thank you.

157
00:12:33,340 --> 00:12:36,000
New technology makes for new threats

158
00:12:38,200 --> 00:12:39,920
What happens now?

159
00:12:40,300 --> 00:12:43,241
With those paddle ships,
the Calm Belt's not safe.

160
00:12:44,600 --> 00:12:48,817
I hope Vegapunk is happy with
the inconveniences caused us.

161
00:12:48,900 --> 00:12:51,697
The Navy launches a siege.

162
00:12:51,780 --> 00:12:53,817
Those strange new weapons attack.

163
00:12:53,900 --> 00:12:56,500
Then Blackbeard comes for our Empress.

164
00:12:57,740 --> 00:13:00,916
I don't know what we would
have done without your aid.

165
00:13:07,880 --> 00:13:09,677
I can't take much credit.

166
00:13:09,760 --> 00:13:12,878
I couldn't have helped under
different circumstances.

167
00:13:15,180 --> 00:13:17,651
I hate to say it, but I'm not a young man.

168
00:13:21,380 --> 00:13:23,357
I can't hope to defeat Blackbeard.

169
00:13:23,440 --> 00:13:25,157
Not in his current state.

170
00:13:25,240 --> 00:13:27,122
This could have been much worse.

171
00:13:28,620 --> 00:13:31,220
Those weapons, the strange children.

172
00:13:31,740 --> 00:13:33,622
It seems they're quite powerful.

173
00:13:33,780 --> 00:13:37,297
To think the Navy would replace
the seven warlords with machines.

174
00:13:37,380 --> 00:13:39,204
They must be confident in them.

175
00:13:39,900 --> 00:13:42,076
As well they should be, I must admit.

176
00:13:42,380 --> 00:13:45,397
We couldn't even put a scratch
on those wretched little beasts.

177
00:13:45,480 --> 00:13:47,539
But that wasn't the strangest part.

178
00:13:47,820 --> 00:13:52,540
I swear, one of them looked just like
Hancock did when she was a child.

179
00:13:57,940 --> 00:14:01,340
Yes, sir, we'll proceed to
egghead and dock the ship.

180
00:14:03,660 --> 00:14:07,360
As for Captain Kobe, I'm
afraid the news is true.

181
00:14:14,280 --> 00:14:15,377
Captain Kobe,

182
00:14:15,460 --> 00:14:20,560
the hero from the Rocky Port incident
was abducted by Blackbeard, the Emperor?

183
00:14:22,420 --> 00:14:23,250
of the sea.

184
00:14:23,460 --> 00:14:25,137
His fate, unknown.

185
00:14:25,220 --> 00:14:26,560
It's a lie!

186
00:14:26,900 --> 00:14:28,160
I know it is!

187
00:14:28,400 --> 00:14:30,360
Slave would never kill me again!

188
00:14:33,580 --> 00:14:36,977
This has got to be some kind
of setup, I'm telling you!

189
00:14:37,060 --> 00:14:38,220
Yes, I agree.

190
00:14:38,540 --> 00:14:40,540
It doesn't hold up under scrutiny.

191
00:14:40,680 --> 00:14:43,797
The Revolutionary Army is
opposed to the world nobles.

192
00:14:43,880 --> 00:14:45,998
Kings like Cobra aren't their enemy.

193
00:14:46,100 --> 00:14:49,688
The Revolutionary Army declared
war on the Celestial Dragons.

194
00:14:50,220 --> 00:14:54,140
The Chief of Staff Sabo
assassinated King Cobra of Alabasta.

195
00:14:54,420 --> 00:14:56,380
There it is. Wait.

196
00:14:56,580 --> 00:15:00,220
His daughter Vivi, the Princess
of Alabasta, disappeared?

197
00:15:01,420 --> 00:15:02,540
Oh, Vivi!

198
00:15:02,720 --> 00:15:05,577
If only I could be there
to comfort you right now!

199
00:15:05,660 --> 00:15:06,820
I hope you're okay!

200
00:15:07,580 --> 00:15:09,520
I say we should go to Alabasta!

201
00:15:09,700 --> 00:15:10,935
Turn the ship around!

202
00:15:11,140 --> 00:15:12,397
The King's already dead.

203
00:15:12,480 --> 00:15:13,937
It's too late for us to help.

204
00:15:14,020 --> 00:15:15,777
And what will we even do there?

205
00:15:15,860 --> 00:15:17,997
We don't have any leads on Vivi either.

206
00:15:18,080 --> 00:15:19,917
They lost track of her and Marie Joie.

207
00:15:20,000 --> 00:15:20,980
Then go there!

208
00:15:21,460 --> 00:15:24,240
Head to Marie Joie! What? No.

209
00:15:24,740 --> 00:15:26,797
Surely I must have misheard him, right?

210
00:15:26,880 --> 00:15:28,600
Even there, not that crazy.

211
00:15:28,960 --> 00:15:31,000
I can't hear a damn thing in here!

212
00:15:33,480 --> 00:15:34,977
That's the enemy's stronghold.

213
00:15:35,060 --> 00:15:36,577
We can't just march in there.

214
00:15:36,660 --> 00:15:38,657
You want to pick a fight with Navy HQ?

215
00:15:38,740 --> 00:15:40,840
Why not, huh? What's wrong?

216
00:15:41,140 --> 00:15:42,360
You scared, Zoro?

217
00:15:42,680 --> 00:15:46,621
We don't have a damn thing to go
off Calm the hell down, would you?

218
00:15:48,320 --> 00:15:49,580
Phoebe's dad is dead?

219
00:15:49,900 --> 00:15:50,880
That's horrible!

220
00:15:51,720 --> 00:15:56,540
Even though we're a bunch of
pirates, he was so nice to all of us!

221
00:15:57,220 --> 00:16:02,440
I am grateful from the bottom of my heart
as a father and a native of this land.

222
00:16:03,400 --> 00:16:06,282
Alabasta will forever be
in your dead Straw Hats.

223
00:16:07,060 --> 00:16:08,820
Thank you all very much.

224
00:16:12,960 --> 00:16:18,080
He was the best king in the whole
world Why did he have to die? Vivi!

225
00:16:19,040 --> 00:16:20,497
I'm so worried.

226
00:16:20,580 --> 00:16:23,297
She must be going through so much.

227
00:16:23,380 --> 00:16:24,637
I hope she's okay.

228
00:16:24,720 --> 00:16:26,400
Oh Vivi!

229
00:16:27,420 --> 00:16:28,250
Vivi!

230
00:16:29,180 --> 00:16:31,477
Seems the reverie was quite tumultuous.

231
00:16:31,560 --> 00:16:33,337
It's a shame she got wrapped up in it.

232
00:16:33,420 --> 00:16:36,037
I simply can't imagine
why the revolutionary

233
00:16:36,120 --> 00:16:38,437
army would want to target Alabasta's king.

234
00:16:38,520 --> 00:16:39,900
Hold up a second.

235
00:16:40,080 --> 00:16:41,877
We met the Sabo guy, didn't we?

236
00:16:41,960 --> 00:16:43,160
When was that?

237
00:16:46,960 --> 00:16:48,840
Oh, he came to dress Rosa.

238
00:16:49,140 --> 00:16:51,117
That was when you last saw your bro.

239
00:16:51,200 --> 00:16:52,030
Right, Luffy?

240
00:16:52,113 --> 00:16:54,740
No, Vivi, where did you go?

241
00:16:54,940 --> 00:16:57,420
I need to come for you. Me too.

242
00:16:57,780 --> 00:17:00,420
Come on, we'll rescue her. Rescue!

243
00:17:01,660 --> 00:17:02,490
Yeah!

244
00:17:03,000 --> 00:17:04,882
All of you need to knock it off.

245
00:17:05,140 --> 00:17:06,611
Stop screaming and focus.

246
00:17:07,340 --> 00:17:08,560
Come on, Luffy.

247
00:17:08,880 --> 00:17:12,880
You remember what you said two
years ago when Ace was in trouble?

248
00:17:17,320 --> 00:17:20,320
Ace's adventures are his
own business, good or bad.

249
00:17:22,640 --> 00:17:24,217
You trusted your brother.

250
00:17:24,300 --> 00:17:27,300
You let him fight his own
battles till it got ugly.

251
00:17:29,900 --> 00:17:32,220
You don't think Vivi's weak, do you?

252
00:17:32,400 --> 00:17:34,917
Because I thought she was
pretty smart and tough, too.

253
00:17:35,000 --> 00:17:40,160
When it comes time for us to fight,
we won't back down from any challenge,

254
00:17:40,480 --> 00:17:43,520
but we can't do anything now, so shut up.

255
00:17:45,720 --> 00:17:48,760
If all we can do is yell, let us yell!

256
00:17:49,280 --> 00:17:50,880
Go back to Onigashima!

257
00:17:51,300 --> 00:17:52,280
You're evil!

258
00:17:52,800 --> 00:17:53,940
You green Kaido!

259
00:17:54,160 --> 00:17:55,340
You big green mom!

260
00:17:55,640 --> 00:17:57,440
Mosshead sucks! Boo!

261
00:17:58,440 --> 00:18:00,120
Boo! Boo! Boo!

262
